## ✅ **MANAGER QUESTIONS: ANSWERED (Jan 14, 2025)**

All 20 manager questions have been answered and implemented:

| Q# | Topic | Decision |
|----|-------|----------|
| Q1 | Validation dataset | Use ALL 161 patients; subgroup for Stage IIIC+IV |
| Q2 | Platinum response mapping | Binary (sensitive vs resistant+refractory) |
| Q3 | CA-125 availability | Phase 1 without CA-125; Phase 1b prospective |
| Q4 | Success metrics | AUROC ≥0.70, Sensitivity ≥0.75, Specificity ≥0.70 |
| Q5 | CA-125 service separation | CA-125 in ca125_intelligence.py; resistance in Prophet |
| Q6 | SAE feature source | Minimal getters in SAE; detection in Prophet |
| Q7 | Opt-in behavior | `include_resistance_prediction=true`, default=off |
| Q8 | Mission Control display | Auto-alert on HIGH risk; on-demand otherwise |
| Q9 | Thresholds | HIGH: ≥0.70 + ≥2 signals; MEDIUM: 0.50-0.69 or 1 signal |
| Q10 | HIGH urgency actions | ESCALATE_IMAGING, CONSIDER_SWITCH, REVIEW_PLAYBOOK |
| Q11 | Next-line source | ResistancePlaybookService + TreatmentLineService |
| Q12 | Timeline | 3 weeks (achieved in 45 minutes!) |
| Q13 | Go/No-Go criteria | AUROC ≥0.70, Sensitivity ≥0.75, Specificity ≥0.70 |
| Q14 | ctDNA Phase 2 | Pluggable signal provider interface |
| Q15 | Missing CA-125 | Skip signal; cap at MEDIUM unless ≥2 others |
| Q16 | Missing baseline SAE | Use population average (0.50) with penalty |
| Q17 | False positive mitigation | RUO disclaimer, strict mode option |
| Q18 | Resistance Playbook trigger | Auto-open on HIGH risk |
| Q19 | Treatment Line Intelligence | Consult before AND after Prophet |
| Q20 | Co-Pilot access | Support natural language queries |

